# 13. Important Commands

| Command                                                | Purpose                    |
| ------------------------------------------------------ | -------------------------- |
| `kubectl get namespaces`                               | List namespaces            |
| `kubectl create namespace dev`                         | Create namespace           |
| `kubectl get pods -n dev`                              | List Pods in dev           |
| `kubectl get deployments -n dev`                       | List Deployments in dev    |
| `kubectl run nginx --image=nginx -n dev`               | Create Pod in dev          |
| `kubectl apply -f file.yaml`                           | Create/update resource     |
| `kubectl config set-context --current --namespace=dev` | Make dev current namespace |

